      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If the same amount is added to every observation, the average changes by that same amount.\n\nFor 10, 20, 30 the average is 20.\nAdd 5 to each: 15, 25, 35.\nThe new average is 25.\n\nEvery value moved up by 5, so the equal share also moved up by 5.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
